	(text "Absolute current limit: 5A\nFault current: 3,125A (corresponds to 20W @ 6,4V)\nFault timer: ~400ms to trigger, 1s to recover\nIs also used as power inhibit that \nis triggered by the DS, RBF and UVLO."
